<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>One button — Taptime</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/app.css"></head><body class="min-h-screen bg-porcelain text-ink antialiased"><main class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-md flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-8"><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-tappa-green">taptime</span> <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/70">punchless</span></header><section class="docket"><p class="docket-label">Step 2 of 3</p><h1 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">One button</h1></section><section class="bg-paper border border-line px-4 py-4"><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/85">The page opens with your name on it and a single button. Press it — that is the whole thing.</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/85">Taptime works out whether you are arriving or leaving, so you never have to choose.</p></section> <a href="/activate/tour?step=3" class="tap-button flex items-center justify-center">Next</a><a href="/activate/done" class="flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center text-sm text-ink/70">Skip the tour</a></main></body></html>